<view class="screen"><view class="eyebrow">AI 每日指导</view><view class="title">把今天，<text>{{'\n'}}</text>安排得更顺一点。</view><view class="tag">今天剩余 {{remaining}} / 30 次 · 北京时间零点重置</view><view class="fine">AI 辅助建议。调整需经过规则校验并由你确认，当前计划不会因聊天直接改变。</view><view wx:if="{{!vm.config.aiEnabled}}" class="notice">AI 服务暂未开放，你仍可继续执行已有计划。</view><view class="fine">提问时，必要的身体摘要、计划、近期记录和对话会交由 腾讯云 CloudBase AI 处理。</view><navigator class="link" url="/pages/privacy/index">隐私与数据说明</navigator><view class="section-title">{{date}} 的指导</view><view wx:for="{{messages}}" wx:key="id"><view class="chat-message chat-user">你：{{item.message}}</view><view class="chat-message" user-select="true">教练：{{item.reply}}</view><navigator wx:if="{{item.adjustment}}" class="link" url="/pages/progress/index" open-type="switchTab">结合真实感受进行复评，查看调整建议</navigator></view><button wx:if="{{nextOffset !== null}}" class="link" bindtap="earlier" disabled="{{busy}}">继续查看当天记录</button><button class="link" bindtap="previous" disabled="{{busy}}">查看前一天</button><textarea value="{{message}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="1000" auto-height="true" placeholder="例如：今天只有 10 分钟，怎么安排？"/><button class="primary" bindtap="send" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy || !vm.isMember || !vm.config.aiEnabled || remaining===0}}">{{pending?'重试本次指导':'问问教练'}}</button><view wx:if="{{pending}}"><button class="secondary" bindtap="query" disabled="{{busy}}">查询上一条结果</button><button class="link" bindtap="abandon" disabled="{{busy}}">清空输入，稍后在历史中查看</button></view><navigator class="secondary" url="/pages/plan/index">回到我的计划</navigator></view>
